WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.640
- Well, Michelle I'd ask
how quarantine has been,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.410
but you have twin toddlers at home.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.292
So basically you need wine and a nanny.

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:09.990
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:10.823
- Yes.

00:00:10.823 --> 00:00:11.656
- Yeah.

00:00:12.576 --> 00:00:15.070
- So there's Hazel and
Otis I love them so much.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.290
This has been a joyful marathon.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:22.710
I just wish I had cleaned
spoons at some point in the day.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.750
I mean, I've never talked
to a dishwasher so often,

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.863
but here we are!

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.850
- Oh, my gosh. I know,
the cleaning is insane.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.400
So are you like me?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.360
Your only alone time is
maybe in the bathroom?

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.940
- Oh, it's my favorite.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.330
I just sit on the toilet
and answer emails.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.163
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:39.163 --> 00:00:39.996
- Me too!

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.860
- Is that what it is? I
mean, it's really me time.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.480
It's very quiet in there.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.135
I've never enjoyed tile
and porcelain so much.

00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:49.870
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:50.703
- It is funny though,

00:00:50.703 --> 00:00:52.060
because I always look at
myself while I'm sitting there

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:54.230
with my phone just
trying to be productive.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.410
I don't even take the time to pee.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.990
I just have to be doing
something else like while-

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.780
I'm like, "This is an issue
for society, I think."

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:06.500
But Cheryl, so was it like
that with your daughter?

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.333
- At my house?

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.166
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.860
- Oh, I sit in the driveway in my car.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.182
- What?

00:01:12.182 --> 00:01:13.015
- Yes.

00:01:13.015 --> 00:01:13.920
- Yeah, that's my time.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.070
- What? Do you just listen to music? Or-

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:21.410
- Yes, I listen to music.
I talk on the phone.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:24.710
It's the only place I have any privacy.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.890
So if I want to talk
about anybody in my house,

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:28.730
I have to sit in the car to do it.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.450
- Oh my God, that's so bad.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.190
- I love doing a good therapy session

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.250
on the phone in the car,

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.950
because then no one in the house can hear

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:35.919
what you're saying about them.

00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:37.170
- [Cheryl] Yes, that's right!

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.690
- Oh! Man, I should worry about that more.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.853
Yeah, I don't-

00:01:41.853 --> 00:01:42.953
(audience laughs)

00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:44.740
I just have mine on
speaker phone. I'm like-

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.440
- [Cheryl] You let them hear it.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.090
- Like, you're going to hear
it eventually. I'm open.

